    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20528" root="سلك" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَلَّكٌ</span></b>  <i>Slender,</i> or <i>lean,</i> (IDrd, K, TA,) <i>in
body;</i> applied to a man and to a horse. (IDrd,
TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَلَّكٌ الذَّكَرِ</span> <i>Sharp in the head of the
penis:</i> and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَمْلَكٌ الذَّكَرِ</span>. (AA, TA.)

